Third-party code
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

core/upstream/  (GPL-3.0-only)
  Copied from jackotom/hongguo-drama
  https://github.com/jackotom/hongguo-drama
  Commit: see core/UPSTREAM_COMMIT
  Files are kept verbatim from upstream src/native/ (public.js from android/web/),
  except that transport paths are rewired to core/shims/ for JavaScriptCore.
  Per-file SPDX headers and attribution comments are preserved unchanged.

  Upstream itself credits (see headers in each file):
    - woshishiq1/drpys            (signing and Spade algorithms)
    - N3urda/hongguoTV            (via which the above was adapted)
    - tsukiyo-zero/hongguoTV      (ttEncrypt and registration fields)
    - charlie901208/HGTV          (phone login, GPL-3.0-only)
    - jayeeliu, PR #61            (export review limit, GPL-3.0)

core/shims/
  Follow the Native bridge conventions of upstream android/web/.

Reference implementation (no files copied verbatim):
  Amor5207/lvguo-tv (绿果TV, GPL-3.0)
  https://github.com/Amor5207/lvguo-tv
  core/account-feed.cjs, core/phone-login.cjs and core/catalog-more.cjs follow its
  request shapes (account feed, cloud history / favorites, phone login, episode
  comments, avatar URLs, signed write requests). Attribution comments are kept at
  each adapted function.

Player, gesture, danmaku and storage components under HongGuo/Player and
HongGuo/Storage are adapted from DouDuo (https://github.com/81199000/DouDuo,
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 DouDuo contributors) and are distributed here
under GPL-3.0 as part of this combined work.

npm dependencies bundled into HongGuo/Resources/hgcore.js:
  buffer (MIT), core-js (MIT), abortcontroller-polyfill (MIT).
  Their license comments are kept at the end of hgcore.js.

